1
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:19,250
[Moderator] Good evening.
We begin with the question.

2
00:00:22,700 --> 00:00:25,250
[Kennedy] The country is ready
to move again.

3
00:00:29,550 --> 00:00:32,650
[Nixon] The question is what already works,
and what keeps the peace.

4
00:00:39,300 --> 00:00:42,750
[Moderator] Start with what we owe,
and what we can promise.

5
00:00:51,900 --> 00:00:53,450
[Kennedy] We cannot stand still and fall behind.

6
00:00:56,100 --> 00:00:59,600
[Nixon] Not a promise that
outruns what we can pay.

7
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:05,800
[Kennedy] Farmers, cities, schools --
these are the country.

8
00:01:06,850 --> 00:01:10,950
[Nixon] I agree on the goal.
I do not agree on the road.

9
00:01:10,550 --> 00:01:13,200
[Kennedy] Then say it plainly,
and tell us which road.

10
00:01:14,450 --> 00:01:18,450
[Moderator] One sentence each.
What do you offer someone out of work?

11
00:01:30,300 --> 00:01:31,150
[Kennedy] A job, this year.

12
00:01:31,300 --> 00:01:35,150
[Nixon] An economy where the job exists
without a wait on Washington.
